cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  EISForge is freely available under the MIT License. If you use EISForge,
  its analysis modules, curated knowledge resources, or any derived outputs
  in publications, theses, reports, presentations, or software, you are requested to
  cite the repository and the associated Zenodo record below.

title: "EISForge: A Catalyst-Aware Electrochemistry Analysis Toolkit"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-07-07"
license: MIT
